# CODEOWNERS template for velnor service repos
# (velnor-plane-api, velnor-chat-api, velnor-agent-gateway, etc.)
#
# Copy to <repo>/CODEOWNERS and replace <service-team> with the owning team.
# Remove this header comment.

# Default: all changes require engineering review
*                                               @VelnorLabs/engineering

# Service-specific ownership — replace with actual team
src/                                            @VelnorLabs/engineering

# CI/CD config — infra-leads co-approve
.github/workflows/                              @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads
Dockerfile                                      @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads
docker-compose*.yml                             @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads

# Database migrations — require two engineering reviews (high blast radius)
migrations/                                     @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads

# Security-sensitive files
SECURITY.md                                     @VelnorLabs/engineering @VelnorLabs/infra-leads
